# automl

## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Baptcarf/ChallengeMachineLearning
cd ChallengeMachineLearning
```

### Création du conda vierge

```bash
conda create -n automl python=3.11 -y
conda activate automl
```

### Installation

```bash
pip install .
```

### Installation développement

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```